        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "You have ",
            "marks": []
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "reliable conversion tracking",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " and a CPA or ROAS target.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "You can supply ",
            "marks": []
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "good text, images and video",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": ". The campaign builds ads from your assets, so weak assets produce weak ads.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Search fits when",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Clicks are expensive.",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " In categories like legal services or B2B software, you want to know exactly which query triggered each click.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "You need to defend your brand",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " with full control over copy and landing pages.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Your budget is small.",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " A tight Search campaign on a few high-intent terms is easier to read than a campaign spread across six channels.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h2",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "How to run both without overlap",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Move your brand and best-converting queries to Search as exact match",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " so they take priority.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "number",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Add negative keywords in Performance Max",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " for brand terms you want Search to own and for irrelevant queries.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "number",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Review the search terms report weekly",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " in both campaign types and move valuable queries into Search.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "number",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Check the channel performance report",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " to see where Performance Max spends: if most of it goes to one surface, decide whether that's what you want.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "number",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Judge by business results",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": ", ideally new customers and profit, not only by the conversions each campaign reports.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ],
        "listItem": "number",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h2",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Common mistakes",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Leaving brand terms open",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " so Performance Max reports \"conversions\" from people who were already looking for you.",
