          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Performance Max and Search are not rivals so much as tools with different jobs. Use Search where control matters, Performance Max where reach and automation pay off, and the 2025 controls (exact match priority, negative keywords, search terms and channel reports) to keep them from stepping on each other. Start by auditing your brand terms this week: it's the fastest way to find overlap.",
